{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e5d943535134ea6b76c1d872cea863830d94452069086e4cc58f7b2f19480b4", "ja": "レコーディングに向け、現地スタッフとミー\nティング。真は言葉が通じないなりに話し合\nうが、歩は少しカッコをつけてしまい伝わら\nない。レコーディングは難航、自己嫌悪した\n歩は、頭を冷やすために出て行ってしまう。", "zh": "为了录音，和当地工作人员开会。真尽管语言不通，还是努力和他们沟通；而步却有些故意耍帅，结果没能让对方理解。录音进展得很不顺利，自我厌恶的步为了冷静一下，独自离开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6c093ddf11b83fe7d594e849d237b26ce01705bde44c113539866263bfcbcbba", "ja": "（今日からレコーディングが始まる。まずは、\n現地のディレクターさんと曲のミーティングだ！）", "zh": "（从今天开始录音。首先要和当地的导演开个会，讨论歌曲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1001_director", "source_sha256": "d48345c08a842a0f30d8c89eb6e35f11d320eba0b3e293b572bad2f5c559e08d", "ja": "ハーイ！　アユム、マコト、ナイストゥーミーチュ！\nレッツドゥーアワベスト！", "zh": "嗨！步、真，很高兴认识你们！\n一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2fca55da5058a0b75d4f5b8ba1d90bce5c60e3fe6ca69d8a94fdac7317c30f9b", "ja": "あ、あはははっ、OK、イエスイエス！　……って、\n英語でミーティングとか聞いてないんだけど！？", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈哈，OK，YES YES！……等等，\n我可没听说要用英语开会啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "73fd874d032601125a3efff086d2d29aee99f9ced9a0dde0dd83cd215fe566e8", "ja": "大丈夫、ちゃんと通訳さんにも来てもらってるから。\n現地スタッフさんとは、ちゃんと意思疎通しないとな。", "zh": "没事的，我也好好请了翻译过来。\n必须得和当地的工作人员好好沟通才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "5ec89525c3855979cb1b112b1254b91c7f81a3d5cfb1d9599dc681844c12318c", "ja": "歩には必要ないと思うけど、\nボクは英語、話せないからさ。ゴメン、歩！", "zh": "我觉得步应该不需要吧，\n但我不会说英语。抱歉，步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c10238aa912f2d2dcfaafdf5816c6734f8b5e0cb1e3f757e82353769f199e81f", "ja": "えっ？　う、うん……。\nま、まあ、いいんじゃない？　あはははは……、はあ。", "zh": "诶？　嗯、嗯……。\n嘛、也没什么不好吧？　啊哈哈哈哈……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "03e0c7361677bb9266a38f2b65a1ea4abb320da21f96e3102838cbf410922d0d", "ja": "歩が思ったことは、直接伝えてくれていいから。\nボクのことは気にしないでね！", "zh": "步想说什么，直接告诉我就好。\n不用在意我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a36ce0d2de12c16e484c7a3d4b1c864438bc00c3e4612858fef86026328018d9", "ja": "（そして、収録前のミーティングが始まり……）", "zh": "（然后，录音前的会议开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "f06ca1761fc13e470f038c7d6a72a8f7f425ac11f0711b947fdf0b040f222435", "ja": "デモを聞いた時に、ガツン！とした\n力強さみたいなものを感じたんです！", "zh": "听到样曲的时候，我感受到了一种迎面而来的强劲力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "71199b595184382979087449de3746cf39b75d898c453e8385a553fd3740fb3b", "ja": "それが表現できたらなって思ってるんですが、\nどうですか？", "zh": "如果能把那种感觉表现出来就好了，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1010_director", "source_sha256": "c9cef02bb7f0b4a7d5c5b8a29859d5baaa7ba5c4e5e36b164b5564e8424ff695", "ja": "……Oh、パワフルソング！\nオーケーオーケー！　ベリーナイス！", "zh": "……Oh，充满力量的歌！\nOK OK！Very nice！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "6f3e0a9999a48826a15453ba442732ace6f561784c443a0ad7a9d93b7d2ce3ea", "ja": "あ、わかってくれました！？\nへへっ、うれしいです！", "zh": "啊，你明白了！？\n嘿嘿，好开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1013_director", "source_sha256": "74b4c2783b02849f67ea4c9282cf110d9d93acad7a30690f4aa3662390257882", "ja": "ヘイ、アユム！\nテルミーエニシング、プリーズ！", "zh": "嘿，阿步！  \n什么都可以告诉我，拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "65ce3ce5c12904731eb9464bf99bd78545dfd54d580c314d45b7166eb8363a5e", "ja": "えっ、アタシ！？\nあー……えーっと、アタシは……。", "zh": "诶，我吗！？\n啊——……呃……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2aa35c046c9022a2d871a7456f8d36d8ce3989017c8189e68848f8b658234739", "ja": "ダ、ダンス、アンド……パッション！\nこう……ハートをオープンするような、そんな感じ！", "zh": "舞、舞蹈，还有……热情！\n就是那种……敞开心扉的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1016_director", "source_sha256": "4e843e48b69d98dc3f5f2d64a4eb1093d6367261fed74896accc7f2642d21790", "ja": "？？？　パードン？", "zh": "？？？什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2b65a301c23f1a587a8f2c5a3f504d78e37b9fd61608c110d25526e2b59f7d33", "ja": "あ～、だから……ええっと……。\nうーん、ダメだ……出てこない……。", "zh": "啊～，所以说……呃……  \n嗯——不行……想不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1034ea9e278a28b74950ee0ed5cf5e376f5183baacb75b817b5d53ad05b445bf", "ja": "あの、ごめん！　アタシ、なんか調子でないから、\nちょっと外で集中してくるね！", "zh": "那个，抱歉！我总觉得不在状态，\n稍微去外面集中一下精神哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "06ed2421caab5b63840598db2c34dd09ab3ea7e6b769b99f697126628f0ca8d6", "ja": "ええ～っ！？　歩、ミーティングは？", "zh": "诶诶～！？步，会议怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3225d646e11c7ab6c7f4e4d317c1aaa784e177fcb40752dbed90979cac46842e", "ja": "いや、言いたいことはその……一応、言えたから。\nそれに、すぐ戻るからさ。それじゃ！", "zh": "哎，想说的那个……姑且都说完了。\n而且我也马上就回来啦。那就待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2a91892e5d93fb0c3c91f6a426a8491012cdead7a1f17d40234bd43ccc76213", "ja": "歩……行っちゃった。\nホントに大丈夫なのかな……？", "zh": "步……走掉了。\n真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "43bb9c3789405546b6b935c54ed162364703437477c9a8581ebee91c7a859ed7", "ja": "（その後、戻ってきた歩本人の希望で、とにかく\n歌を収録してみる、ということになったのだが……）", "zh": "（之后，在回来后的步本人的要求下，决定先试着录录歌再说，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1023_director", "source_sha256": "69add0ff788905bdfc09cfd18ea81e26b165c6d9c9604dc520d6514b574eee28", "ja": "ノーノー！　モアセクシー！\nアユム・イズ・セクシー！", "zh": "不不！再性感一点！\n步的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0cdf5df02ed71d86228cab01097b82d30df56122598d4be3b64aee3cb57cf8a", "ja": "セクシー！？　いやいや、この曲はそういうんじゃ\nないと思うんだよ。えっと……。", "zh": "性感！？不不，我觉得这首歌不是那种类型的歌。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c7f3779e18a1d7379543138edaf3de39efe6cf33d1b7df8caad8c5c9ef86a569", "ja": "ディスソング・イズ……ダンス！　パッション！\nハッピー！　えっと……パワフル！", "zh": "这首歌是……舞蹈！激情！快乐！呃……活力十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1026_director", "source_sha256": "209bd8e1abf34188129a3824b2b646795ddab8747a4449a17835eb4fa469abfd", "ja": "ノー！　パワフル・イズ・マコト！\nアユム・イズ・セクシー！", "zh": "不对！真是活力十足！\n步可是性感十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fb4de119f9d009d46375c9d7a85e86b65812795db4e1e653fc9f2a263d1fcb1d", "ja": "だから、セクシーじゃなくて～！！", "zh": "所以都说了，不是性感啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1028_p", "source_sha256": "97453ffb274014d97067c8ed405e38f288e6e963ee88a2e031c5d9776932d520", "ja": "（意見の違いで、レコーディングが止まってしまった。\nやっぱり、ミーティングが先だったな……）", "zh": "（因为意见不合，录音只好停了下来。果然还是应该先开会啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "e0c4c447cb0765a53fec3bf047616c36c430d4dba631dc06f5a6064cf8dbcfc7", "ja": "いいなぁ、歩……。ボクも\n「マコト・イズ・セクシー」って言われたいな。", "zh": "真羡慕你啊，步……我也想被人说“真好性感”啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9b596224b9b6a0aedca2788b80e6266def76cbc87e7bbfd8df248756f0ee2008", "ja": "セクシー……。そうだな。\nよし、真から先に録ろう。", "zh": "性感……也是啊。\n好，那就先录真吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "091359cef43880177b692a6825dfcdfc6831f10309a9a8693fd50704c9b5d2b6", "ja": "えっ。マコト・イズ・セクシーですか！？", "zh": "诶。是真性感路线吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1032_p", "source_sha256": "30aaffbe18a637475a6f053f311f5c772d32ee7548955d0713596d227ac94199", "ja": "そういう方向性の話、真はもうできてるからな。\n真を録ってる間に、俺は歩と話してみるよ。", "zh": "真已经能驾驭那种路线了。录制真的时候，我去和步聊聊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "0eda36702653c2ff1743147525538fb7ad3e284ee3b551561451ccbd248826e2", "ja": "あ……、はい、わかりました。\nそれじゃ、ガツン！と決めてきますっ！", "zh": "啊……好，我明白了。\n那么，我会干脆利落地拿下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "cf619b068643b36a6d3aada42daefd645c46e87b91333bac6eb79c4613dc34da", "ja": "青い惑星～♪　大きな～♪", "zh": "蓝色的星球～♪　巨大的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1035_director", "source_sha256": "da6f9ab13e5d8ccbd3229af1242f52b6946667bc09339a6ae2bb70b82be32fd1", "ja": "Wow！　ベリーパワホー！　イッツ・クール！", "zh": "Wow！Very powerful！It's cool！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1036_p", "source_sha256": "941e635da6c2c3c2e501ed60be9e63c5178471b27930f368c7fd98694e5ca988", "ja": "（うん、真のレコーディングは問題なさそうだ。\nとなると……）", "zh": "（嗯，真录音应该没问题了。这样的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "66ac9b88dea8ed1a5c456a6af3aaae92bedc7723ec945b92b6b56def68383ccc", "ja": "真、堂々と歌ってる……。やっぱ、すごいな。\nミーティングでも、堂々としてた……。", "zh": "真，唱得真是落落大方……果然好厉害啊。\n开会的时候，也一直都很从容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9490aa6f958220d5d2a8ba57a4dc092b69f4f7b9862f5ce5b8dd670f1d31daba", "ja": "まあ、アタシはミーティングもサボったし。\n言葉も気持ちも通じ合えなくて、当たり前か。", "zh": "不过，我连开会都翘掉了。\n无法心意相通也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b89db60af4be520d1b4a279deeb158783323efbe3385f632e4e32151c5a03d38", "ja": "ヘンにカッコつけなきゃよかった。\nああっ、なにやってんだろ、アタシ……。", "zh": "早知道就不装酷了。\n啊啊，我这是在干什么啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "75a6c1ad08ea5b30ca26b24aa00bf75ed400534b51ec56650591ecbbf2687077", "ja": "歩、ちょっといいかな。", "zh": "步，方便聊一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "9fdbc1daa3d5ca110b3a5e0db26c998c4a46ecc399bca345c5cce69b54a65170", "ja": "誰だって調子が出ない日はあるよ。とりあえず、\n気持ちをリセットして、ゼロから立て直さないか？", "zh": "谁都会有状态不好的日子。先试着把心情归零，从头重新振作起来怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "46e87a0a58eb7167cb0efd654dfc487916114564e4789cd901b803a4d67cfb92", "ja": "ゼロから……。ゼロ……。\n……あー、ダメダメ！　こんなんじゃダメだ！", "zh": "从零开始……零……  \n……啊——不行不行！这样可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b0e494a2b3097b35468034f6e3a5cf8e0c37f7536ab74c55e0a6608b8bb4ba24", "ja": "ごめん、{$P$}！\nアタシ、ちょっと飲み物買ってくるよ！", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}！\n我去买点喝的回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d959f1112454832d5b78deb58f549fc050425debcf44227dc07f94efcbf513db", "ja": "そうか？　それなら、俺も一緒に……。", "zh": "这样啊？那我也一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0125_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_03_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "02438686c83e145335e26c3431419e4db5270d90ff2163599c70dd293e9cf1c9", "ja": "いいよ、ニューヨークは庭みたいなものだし。\n真を見ててあげて。……それじゃ！", "zh": "没事啦，纽约就跟我的后花园一样。\n你去看着真吧。……那我走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
